pan style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"&gt;Hello ladies...&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"&gt;I will be getting married in Cancun in April of 2016 at Secrets The Vine Cancun. I pretty much have everything booked expect hair and makeup. I have been in contact with a few vendors. However, Backstage Hair and Makeup caught my eye. I would like to know if anyone has used them for their hair and makeup? Or possibly any recommendations. I am nervous about booking Backstage because I want to make sure they are legit. Any recommendations will help.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; :D&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"&gt;Thank you!!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910491,"PostDate":1454542911,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">Hello ladies...<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">I will be getting married in Cancun in April of 2016 at Secrets The Vine Cancun. I pretty much have everything booked expect hair and makeup. I have been in contact with a few vendors. However, Backstage Hair and Makeup caught my eye. I would like to know if anyone has used them for their hair and makeup? Or possibly any recommendations. I am nervous about booking Backstage because I want to make sure they are legit. Any recommendations will help.\u00a0<\/span><\/span>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">Thank you!!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ellanamariah@aol.com","IpAddress":"108.29.158.190","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1454542369,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"ellanamariah","Id":286124,"Name":"ellanamariah","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79919","Title":"Cancun Hair And Makeup","LastPostDate":1454542911},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
